  {
   "id": "6f614f12a1e9",
   "unit_id": "6f614f12a1e9d496ab2420fa78d9fc56bceed56844d299764dad4d1b6560f3ad",
   "revision_key": "33976105500239de448cdbe6c7ae34a8a8722f70bbe27566802c8d702fba8529",
   "translation_file": "mod-tome.lua",
   "translation_line": 40929,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/zones/void/npcs.lua",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "During the Age of Haze nearly all gods were destroyed by the Sher'tul Godslayers. However, a small number escaped.\nGerlyk, the creator of the Human race, prefered to flee into the void between the stars than to face death. He has been trapped ever since.\nThe sorcerers tried to bring him back and nearly succeeded.\nNow you have come to finish what the Sher'tul began. Become a Godslayer yourself.",
   "target": "在混沌纪，几乎所有神祇都被夏·图尔的弑神者所杀。但仍有少部分逃离。\n盖里克，人类缔造者，则选择走进群星间的虚空来避免死亡。他从此一直被困在那里。\n巫师们曾试图将他召回，并且险些成功。\n现在是你结束夏·图尔人未完成事业的时刻了，去成为一名弑神者吧。",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/zones/void/npcs.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
